cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Abliterator, please cite it as below."
title: "Abliterator"
abstract: "Abliterator is a new instrument that enables vector bending of a music AI model that is playable live and in realtime. It steers, squashes and turns the vectors Magenta RealTime 2 computes with, between its transformer layers, while it plays."
type: software
